{"sba-sakura-38745":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n こんばんは〜\n \n \n \n 昨日と今日は2ndシングル「BAN」の\n 2.3回目の個別ミーグリでした🌸\n \n 2日間ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYE33917XCMMQ33GGMK0FX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYE450TTCKCJSZY5SZ4XH8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 5.6月の個別ミーグリも、\n 全握のミーグリもお待ちしてます〜\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 4月23日に発売された「BRODY」さんに\n ゆいちゃんとの写真とインタビューが\n 掲載されています！\n \n 欅坂と櫻坂のことや、\n 偶然の答えのMVのことなどお話ししました！\n \n \n \n ミーグリの休憩中に\n BRODYを見ていたんだけど、\n りさの写真もおぜの写真も可愛かった〜\n \n 思わず連絡しましたっ🍈\n \n \n \n ぜひチェックしてください〜！             "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-15814":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶⭐︎\n \n \n \n \n \n 本日showroom 配信ありがとうございました〜!\n 18:30〜でちょっと早いかな?💦\n って思ったけどたくさんの方が見て下さりました!嬉しいな〜😌😌\n \n \n \n 今日はゲームアプリ、欅のキセキの撮影で一緒に撮影をした犬のぬいぐるみと一緒に配信したんです🐶\n \n この子の名前を決めたくて、、、笑😊\n \n 名前はカフェオレくんです!🐶🐶\n そして、私がカフェラテちゃん。\n 2人合わせて、カフェインです。☕️\n (笑ってくださ〜〜い)\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYM5936GJ01YZV89ZMPBG71","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYM5A53XGZMJA4VW4Y4DH0Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 可愛いでしょ🐶🐶🐶\n \n 久々にぶっ飛んでる虹花でした、、笑笑🙇‍♀️💓\n \n \n \n また配信します!\n 今度はアイスクリーム作る配信をしたくて、だれか誘いたい✨\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私の後は、美穂ちゃん^^\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYM5B62VBC69VTY79Q94CKG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 可愛いね〜🐼\n \n \n \n \n \n 今日も幸せでした^^\n \n \n \n 石森虹花🌈🌼"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-41464":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　こんばちは　水面が反射して壁がキラキラ光っているのが好きだな〜と突然気づきました。　　佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒　　　「全国おひさま化計画2021」が無事終わりました🥰会場に足を運んでくださった皆さん配信でご覧になってくださった皆さん本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終公演のMCでもお話しさせていただいたのですが、おひさまの皆さんのおかげで始まる当初は不安だったツアーでしたが皆んなで完走することができました！\n皆さんがいてくださって初めてこの空間が完璧なものになるんだなーって毎回沁みるように感じていました。一度として同じライブはなくておひさまの皆さんのそれぞれ一人一人違う生活があるのにあの瞬間だけは同じ時を共有するというのは本当に奇跡のような時間ですよね、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひなくり2021」の開催も決定されましたが、私達も魅力的なグループであり続けられるように挑戦し続けたいと思います🎅🎁\n日向坂46公式サイトちなみに応募がもう始まっています🎄是非遊びに来てください〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSPM1CQYP00DYKSFKS7ZZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSQM2ANY017KAK0WGXQEH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSRNWATESA0NJ9TJ0GS2Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSSP3KE91HKAAWXJ4NYED","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSTQB4FX5FBZPH3KZP1TB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSVQB45FJPHXXKYHE8797","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSWT9KV7K3SC65J867MDY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSXS908AKJWR521KKGCH8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSYT21K6846JFE874PCC1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RSZT614EMZ90AE2J6B8AR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT0SS2FZEP2MQRSJ2V4W8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT1TC18QWZDSET3AGA2HN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT2W33YDDE6N0BGDQ7R74","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT3X570HBRRD4A4PPPPPC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT4VPWGPMDM12D9SAFGM9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT5X10P34E6445BCX8R9H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT6YDEXCWTRFJKGE37K14","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT81GZQXHW6SQR55XZJGS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RT94W9Y3BTFYA1Z17DXR2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RTA4X7YWKQXSXVGE5RQCC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RTB5A2NRSVD1Q6VF1ETVR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n思い出写真達〜🦕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RTC5PQZT3K2WT3F2E2CFR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RTD5J2FX45B8E8DSQWE6Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n皆んなお疲れ様〜❤️‍🔥仲間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ🦦本日19:00〜テレビ朝日「東大生ランキング」に出演させていただきます！\n行きたい場所がたっくさん増えて本当に勉強になり楽しかったのです🌝是非ご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月27.28日9:55〜TBS「Let’s 美バディ」に濱岸と出演させていただきます🕺くみひよと一緒に身体を動かしましょう〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16564":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんですー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の日記は\nなんか暗くなっちゃってごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのコメント\n本当にありがとうございました(´；；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近なんとなく気持ちが落ち気味だったんだけど\nコメント読んでると\nなんだか涙が止まらなくなって、すっきりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの理想は\nお人形さんみたいになること！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想のアイドル像ってのもあって\nファンのみなさんには\n華やかなところだけ見てほしいなって思ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり悔し涙とか弱音とか\nそーゆーのは\nほんとは隠しておきたいなって思うんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんとなくこの前の日記は\nそこを無しには伝えられなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん今は難しいなー( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んでてもしゃーないし\n目の前のことを\nがんばってみよっかなって思うよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもなかよくしてね＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まともな日記を書いてなかったのね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ溜まってた報告＆告知祭りでも\n開催しようかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎NOGIBINGO!2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#3は妄想シチュエーション\n#4は実家デミー賞 でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#3は なかいさんコンビで\n放課後の教室で(あなた)を取り合うってゆ\nちょっと贅沢なひとコマ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"贅沢なって自分で言うもんじゃないよね←\nほら、取り合いとか\nしないしされないタチだからさ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再現......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してみたけど\nエア握手みたくなってる(´；；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃいます！(あなた)を取り合ってるの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#4は実家デミー賞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家ルール\n「カレーを食べるときはパジャマに着替える」\nってのがあるんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？誰も共感してくれないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマにカレーが飛んじゃう......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その通りですね(｀；ω；´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあどうしたらいいんだろう\n前掛けすればいいのかな\nでもそしたら 前掛けにカレーが飛んじゃう......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレーって難しいのね(｀；ω；´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎月刊エンタメ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最新号で中３組が対談してます\n理想のバレンタインも考えました\nぜひチェックしてみてくださーい＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎朝日新聞 語彙読解力検定"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"準２級合格しました＼( ^O^ )／\nよのなか科の授業もまた受けてきたよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎anan"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドル特集号的なのが発売されてて\n我らがななみん(橋本奈々未ちゃん)も出てるのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで中元姉妹って\n紹介してくださってるよ( ^ω^ )◎\nちらっとだけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつさーん(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前久々に会って\nひめたーん会いたかったーって\nぎゅーってしてくれるまなつさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーらぶ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前似た写め載せたけど\nちょっと違うんだからね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見切れてるとまと(大和里菜ちゃん)\nかわゆーす◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近髪が伸びてきて切らんといけんなーと\n思ってるんだけどだるいしめんどくさいです。\nひめたんびーむでカットしてくれますか？\n嫌です( ^ω^ )美容院行ってくださーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは何茶が好き？\n麦茶！\n麦茶とってもすきよー\n麦茶ゆーてもいろいろあるけど\nうちの麦茶は薄くもなく濃くもなく\n普通の麦茶ですよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこのオープニングって\nすしざんまいだよね？\nあれ誰がやろうって言い出したの？ww\n初夢回のやつだよねー\n言いだしっぺは誰だったっけな(笑)\nあんなにシンクロしたオープニングは\nなかなかないかなーと思うんですけども\nひめたんあのコマーシャル\nまだ見たことないんだよね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壊れかけのradioと卵かけのradio\nどっちが欲しい？\n卵かけのラジオ美味しそうーって\nばーかー(っ´ω`c)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりりーぬさんは、、、飛べますか？\nそれともひめたんのように背面跳びですか？？\n翼がないのできっと飛べません\n背面......背面は無理なんじゃないかな\nベリーロールも足短いから多分無理だろうなー\nなんなんだろうねあの鳥さん！なんもできんやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姫たんてどこの国の姫なの？\nそーいえばひめたんは\nどこの国のお姫さまなんだろうか\nそうだ国を作ってしまおう！\nひめたんの王国の名前(´；；｀)誰か教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのブログの\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/02/01/6476745/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわけで\nもう２月ですか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やだなー時の流れってのははやいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２月といえばなんですかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"節分でしょー\nバレンタインでしょー\n乃木坂ちゃんのバースデーでしょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ何か楽しそうかも！☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}